#: f838c295cd6b4c5fb972194701a55b5d
msgid "Install WSL"
msgstr "安装 WSL"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:4
#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:63
#: 15b63bd3280244c18f284e1e0652e773 9674c82e706d4cfab49547a591d23e97
msgid "1. Prerequisites"
msgstr "1.安装前提"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:5
#: a2a82dd9a69149cda610924c65c42a0b
msgid ""
"To successfully run WSL 2 on Windows 10+, the following hardware "
"conditions need to be met first:"
msgstr "要在 Windows 10+ 上成功运行 WSL 2，首先需要满足以下硬件条件："

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:7
#: f512b5f045c3410d976ece8b4fb2cad3
msgid "64-bit processor with Secondary Level Address Translation (SLAT);"
msgstr "64 位处理器，带二级地址转换 (SLAT)；"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:8
#: 21f8b923f8d3422fa0cf600dc842f02b
msgid "4GB of system RAM;"
msgstr "4GB 系统内存；"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:9
#: 435976238f9b46ceb88e8407aba85dd7
msgid "Enable hardware virtualization in the BIOS;"
msgstr "在 BIOS 中启用硬件虚拟化；"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:11
#: 36ef33e45eda4bdaa687aed260412e5b
msgid ""
"You must be running Windows 10 version 2004 and higher (internal version "
"19041 and higher) or Windows 11 in order to use the following commands, "
"otherwise a more complex manual installation is required, which is mainly"
" automated here. *## 2) Download and install Windows 10"
msgstr ""
"您必须运行 Windows 10 2004 及以上版本（内部版本 19041 及以上）或 Windows "
"11，才能使用以下命令，否则需要进行更复杂的手动安装，这里主要是自动安装。*## 2) 下载并安装 Windows 10"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:13
#: ffd6dae31d5a4962a36c5e503da4897a
msgid "2. Download and install WSL"
msgstr "2.下载并安装 WSL"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:15
#: 7cfdfec4018e4f53a845479bbc5fb42c
msgid ""
"Open PowerShell or Windows Command Prompt in administrator mode by right-"
"clicking and selecting “Run as administrator”, enter the command 'wsl "
"--install', and restart the computer after the installation is "
"complete**. This command will enable the features needed to run WSL and "
"install the Ubuntu distribution of Linux."
msgstr ""
"通过右键单击并选择 “以管理员身份运行”，以管理员模式打开 PowerShell 或 Windows 命令提示符，输入命令 “wsl "
"--install”，并在安装完成后重新启动计算机**。该命令将启用运行 WSL 和安装 Ubuntu Linux 发行版所需的功能。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:17
#: 18ca422ebfa54d04ac0d03fc4c6343cf
msgid "![Wsl_install](../../../images/wsl_install.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:17
#: 2e621e7448b24868a6ed6777f4bdce91
msgid "Wsl_install"
msgstr "Wsl_install"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:19
#: 55deaf32b8be4e658ac8e6d380835590
msgid "3. Reboot your computer"
msgstr "3.重启电脑"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:21
#: e394c1e64b0c4c358de876ddecf3c522
msgid ""
"Restarting your computer will automatically install the Linux subsystem "
"(Ubuntu by default)."
msgstr "重启电脑将自动安装 Linux 子系统（默认为 Ubuntu）。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:23
#: e613a99d4da34c78a456f7de2fb77892
msgid "![linux_install](../../../images/ubuntu_install.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:23
#: b61dced16b5c49b9b01d11191f8c8bb9
msgid "linux_install"
msgstr "linux_install"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:25
#: 0c12486765244865a6b1a302ca3ebe3a
msgid "4. Check system configuration"
msgstr "4.检查系统配置"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:27
#: fa9ceb1099ad4ad784c07078eeb5ad30
msgid ""
"Check that Windows subsystems and virtual machine platforms for Linux are"
" checked in Control Panel -> Programs → Enable or Disable Windows "
"Features."
msgstr "检查是否已在控制面板 -> 程序 → 启用或禁用 Windows 功能中勾选 Windows 子系统和 Linux 虚拟机平台。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:29
#: 742a61bfa3df402ca79567932bd463d7
msgid "![check_configuration](../../../images/check_Windows_configuration.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:29
#: b278b15baa3441b8ab70fee0bb7abf79
msgid "check_configuration"
msgstr "检查配置"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:31
#: a8de191f40e64505a0bc56fbc3236184
msgid "5. Setting up a username and password"
msgstr "5.设置用户名和密码"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:33
#: df7419f3615b457ca54a5aa785066b94
msgid ""
"After installing WSL, you need to create a user account and password for "
"the newly installed Linux distribution. Click on the “Start” menu to open"
" the Linux distribution (Ubuntu by default). At this point, you will be "
"asked to create a username and password for the Linux distribution. Note "
"that:"
msgstr ""
"安装完 WSL 后，你需要为新安装的 Linux 发行版创建一个用户账户和密码。点击 “开始 ”菜单打开 Linux 发行版（默认为 "
"Ubuntu）。此时，系统会要求你为 Linux 发行版创建一个用户名和密码。请注意："

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:35
#: 610b2ba7322f4ca3816df83b2225dd90
msgid ""
"This username and password is specific to each individual Linux "
"distribution installed, and is not related to the Windows username."
msgstr "该用户名和密码是每个已安装的 Linux 发行版所特有的，与 Windows 用户名无关。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:36
#: 40f2c5b04bcd45fc8dbc4ba514dbca4c
msgid ""
"Nothing is displayed on the screen when you type your password. This is "
"called blind typing. You will not see what you are typing, and this is "
"perfectly normal."
msgstr "输入密码时，屏幕上不会显示任何内容。这叫做盲打。您看不到自己在输入什么，这很正常。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:37
#: bea43751e1a649e0ba2011a9899ee4f2
msgid ""
"After you create a username and password, this account will be the "
"distribution's default user and will be automatically logged in at "
"startup."
msgstr "创建用户名和密码后，该账户将成为发行版的默认用户，并在启动时自动登录。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:38
#: 14988ce4361b4ea6bf7b7c47a8119664
msgid ""
"This account will be treated as a Linux administrator and will be able to"
" run sudo (Super User Do) administrative commands."
msgstr "该账户将被视为 Linux 管理员，可以运行 sudo（超级用户操作）管理命令。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:39
#: 49a2b956f18e421abc13dcd815b31149
msgid ""
"Each Linux distribution running on WSL has its own Linux user account and"
" password. A Linux user account must be configured whenever a "
"distribution is added, reinstalled, or reset."
msgstr ""
"在 WSL 上运行的每个 Linux 发行版都有自己的 Linux 用户账户和密码。每当添加、重新安装或重置一个发行版时，都必须配置一个 "
"Linux 用户账户。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:41
#: 37fef5c73ee34d5781bc0ce946647dfd
msgid ""
"To change or reset the password, open the Linux distribution and enter "
"the command: passwd. You will be asked for your current password, then "
"asked for a new password, and later to confirm the new password."
msgstr "要更改或重置密码，请打开 Linux 发行版并输入命令：passwd。系统会要求你输入当前密码，然后要求你输入新密码，之后再要求你确认新密码。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:43
#: 762a5ad3ad1d447f8396baa47a94fa98
msgid "**Forgot Password**"
msgstr "**忘记密码**"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:45
#: 5ff7e07d0c6b4af48ccdd2ef08b98a2b
msgid ""
"a. Please open PowerShell and enter the root directory of the default WSL"
" distribution with the following command: wsl -u root"
msgstr "a.请打开 PowerShell 并使用以下命令进入默认 WSL 发布的根目录：wsl -u root"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:47
#: 97d54d16ab9c4e2791b204219cb9194d
msgid ""
"If you need to update the forgotten password in a non-default "
"distribution, use the command: wsl -d Debian -u root and replace Debian "
"with the name of the target distribution."
msgstr "如果需要更新非默认发行版中被遗忘的密码，请使用以下命令：wsl -d Debian -u root，并用目标发行版的名称替换 Debian。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:49
#: 7cbbfcacae5d4021abd167667f794b73
msgid ""
"b. After opening the WSL distribution at the root level within "
"PowerShell, you can update the password using this command: passwd "
"<username>, where <username> is the username of the account in the "
"distribution for which you have forgotten the password."
msgstr ""
"b.在 PowerShell 的根级别打开 WSL 发布后，可以使用以下命令更新密码：passwd <username>，其中 "
"<username> 是发布中忘记密码的账户的用户名。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:51
#: 8232773d37a74441966e6546adb5ed78
msgid ""
"c. You will be prompted for a new UNIX password, which you can then "
"confirm. After you have been told that the password has been successfully"
" updated, close the WSL from within PowerShell using the following "
"command: exit."
msgstr ""
"c.系统将提示您输入新的 UNIX 密码，然后您可以确认该密码。在收到密码已成功更新的提示后，在 PowerShell 中使用以下命令关闭 "
"WSL：exit。"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:53
#: 7e6fe67c592b4ff08d3d50d08b724274
msgid "![reset_password](../../../images/reset_unix_passsword.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:53
#: eddc35648ec44398acbe80c49c3e0869
msgid "reset_password"
msgstr "重置密码"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:55
#: f064dec25f234c2d82ef1307ac750999
msgid "6. Checking the WSL version"
msgstr "6.检查 WSL 版本"

#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:57
#: ab05cd56eef643cdaa41a13496d71a23
msgid ""
"You can list the installed Linux distributions and check the WSL version "
"of each distribution by entering the following command in PowerShell or "
"at a Windows command prompt: wsl -l -v, default is WSL 2."
msgstr ""
