#: ../../source/deployment/standalone/windows.md:91
#: a8c0f3a4839847dc9c7d8fa5b0f8badc
msgid ""
"Docker desktop is different from docker in Ubuntu in that it has a "
"special mechanism: it loads a block device inside wsl2, and then uses the"
" full docker environment directly from this block device, including the "
"docker commands, docker proxy, and docker image directory. ubuntu Do not "
"install docker on ubuntu, use docker desktop."
msgstr ""
"Docker desktop 与 Ubuntu 中的 docker 不同，它有一个特殊的机制：它会在 wsl2 "
"中加载一个块设备，然后直接从这个块设备使用完整的 docker 环境，包括 docker 命令、docker 代理和 docker 镜像目录。 "
"ubuntu 不要在 ubuntu 上安装 docker，请使用 docker desktop。"

